# Narrow, owner-authorized exception to the blanket *.zevtc PII guard above:
# the anonymized axilog integration fixture, so the real-parse tests run in CI.
# Every character name in it is `Anon<N>`, every account `:Anon<N>.<digits>`,
# every guild id zeroed — verified before commit. `.anon.` is required in the
# name, so a raw capture dropped in this directory stays ignored.
!test-fixtures/axilog/*.anon.zevtc

